  <p id="c-songshu-050-hushengzhi:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-songshu-050-hushengzhi:p001:m0000" ref="uj4_46o_tww">胡盛之</persName>為虜生禽，<persName id="c-songshu-050-hushengzhi:p001:m0008" ref="d10_1e6_850">托跋燾</persName>寵之，常在左右。<persName id="c-songshu-050-hushengzhi:p001:m0019" ref="uj4_46o_tww">盛之</persName>有勇力，初為長沙王<persName id="c-songshu-050-hushengzhi:p001:m0030" ref="59f_167_cb3">義欣</persName>鎮軍參軍督護，討劫譙郡，縣西劫有馬步七十，逃隱深榛，<persName id="c-songshu-050-hushengzhi:p001:m0058" ref="uj4_46o_tww">盛之</persName>挺身獨進，手斬五十八級。</p>
</text>
